    story: Leif Viperclap was born in a midwife alley birth, where blood, bandages,
      and unpaid favors were never far away. As a child, Leif Viperclap lived through
      the refugee camp years, learning salvage, grief, and how quickly ordinary life
      can vanish. As a young adult, Leif Viperclap worked through a counting house
      guard, turning caravan routes and roadside fights into a working education.
      They enter the dojo to earn more than a season of escort work.
